hin the range of $\\theta ,$ we subtract $2\\pi .$\n\n$$\n\\frac{3\\pi }{2}-2\\pi =-\\frac{\\pi }{2}.\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(-1)=-\\frac{\\pi }{2}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(-1) & =10\\cdot (-\\frac{\\pi }{2}) \\\\  & =-5\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978511/state.json" "file_sha256" "f5e37af4efb82e70105a48b3112259cb413aaf86365fb13831238eaa9bd472a3" "basis" 832 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978511/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-117412" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978511/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "e0e41e674a2e310958f5a3889ed2f916ca1f6a46d3cd0a1bc1b29dfac5fef70f" "basis" 832 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978511/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-117412" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978511/state.json" "file_sha256" "f5e37af4efb82e70105a48b3112259cb413aaf86365fb13831238eaa9bd472a3" "basis" 832 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978511/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-117412" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "-5\\pi "] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978511/state.json" "file_sha256" "f5e37af4efb82e70105a48b3112259cb413aaf86365fb13831238eaa9bd472a3" "basis" 832 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/